# The time servers Patrone uses in place of Ubuntu's ntp.ubuntu.com pools,
# run by three operators other than Canonical (Cloudflare, Netnod and PTB),
# each authenticated with NTS. Each offers its servers to anyone; TimeNL
# (SIDN Labs) asks vendors to ask first, so it's not here
# (docs/COMPLIANCE.md, item 7).
server time.cloudflare.com iburst nts
server nts.netnod.se iburst nts
server ptbtime1.ptb.de iburst nts
